  "details": "Often when I play in public worlds the overwhelming majority of people I want to have avatar/voice blocked are people on desktop. Trolling from desktop users is far more common than people who use headsets, and I find myself wanting to block people on desktop than Visitors. As a result I believe the solution would be adding shield settings per-platform, where I can choose to totally block out desktop users as well as Quest and Index (if i wanted).",
